- Add CPUID.0x24.0.EBX[7:0] into allow list. There is a mismatch of the
  description about CPUID.0x24.0.EBX[7:0], which is listed as
  "XFAM & CPUID_Enabled & Native" but should be "XFAM & CPUID_Enabled &
  Configured & Native".
