To avoid the busy waiting could we:
```
// Globaly:
sem_t sig_sem;
...
// Prior to setting up the signal handler:
sem_init(&sig_sem, 0, 0);
...
// Here:
if (ftrace->target.use_bpf) {
   sem_wait(&sig_sem);
} else {
   while (!done) {
...
}
// In the signal handler:
if (ftrace->target.use_bpf) {
   sem_post(&sig_sem);
}
...
// After removing the signal handler:
sem_destroy(&sig_sem);
```

